Here is the complete, production-grade, self-contained implementation in **modern C++20**, engineered for high-throughput multicore architectures with explicit memory ordering, cacheline isolation, lock-free EBR, dynamic SSI tracking, Lehman-Yao $B^{\text{link}}$-tree indexation, and vectorized group-commit WAL.

